// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2389236056" "The Penumbra Elites are world-class special forces operatives, as well trained as any Navy SEAL. They're expert insurgents, capable of infiltrating a target swiftly and silently, then taking it down. Elites undergo a basic super soldier regimen designed to heighten their stealth, accuracy, and concentration. These enhancements make them incredibly dangerous, especially when encountered in force."
// DisplayNames :
"P4251335851" "Penumbra Elite Marksman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2044351877" "Penumbra Elite Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2693204090" "Penumbra Elite Assault"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3809449413" "A Penumbra Elite at the peak of his game may earn the rank of Adjutant, and with it a large upgrade in super soldier serum. He is on the verge of Cor Leonis status, and his mind has become focused with laser-like intensity. High ranking Elites are some of the best shots and most dedicated insurgents in the world. They can, and have, assassinated heads of state as well as world famous heroes."
// DisplayNames :
"P647203646" "Penumbra Elite Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Sniper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2608654338" "Those gifted with incredible accuracy are quickly transferred into the Penumbra division, where they undergo lengthy treatments to refine their abilities. The Sharpshooters are natural loners and disdain associating with the rank and file. The only praise they seek is the satisfaction of a silent kill."
// DisplayNames :
"P22536681" "Penumbra Elite Sharpshooter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1649260699" "While most Elites concentrate on learning the basic skills required for special ops, the Archons receive additional training in tactics. They're also trained in technological skills, such as wire tapping and circumventing security systems. Combined with their prodigious super soldier enhancements, these skills make Elite Archons well-prepared to plan and carry out small covert ops."
// DisplayNames :
"P3188436197" "Penumbra Elite Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Boss_Lycanthrope 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P757862208" "The Cor Leonis of the Penumbra have transcended mere special ops status. They are each unto themselves a powerful covert force, capable of taking on operations that would normally require an entire team of commandos. In addition to their enhanced physical and mental attributes, they receive training in security systems, computer infiltration, and surveillance equipment. In many ways, they are the perfect spies."
// DisplayNames :
"P3138019524" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Marksman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P114750233" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4169595955" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3187768755" "Unlike their counterparts in the other branches of the Council's hierarchy, the Penumbra Cor Leonis Adjutants have considerable autonomy. The Council feels that the subversive activities that fall within the Penumbra's purview require a certain amount of independence. This makes the Penumbra Cor Leonis quite unpredictable at times - and thus, quite deadly."
// DisplayNames :
"P1627379537" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Lycanthrope_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3128900752" "The Penumbra Cor Leonis Archons author their own plans to sow terror and fear across Paragon City. Many are in command of small military cells, completely cut off from their compatriots - both for the sake of security, and to encourage independent thinking."
// DisplayNames :
"P1548357666" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3026349267" "The Vortex are the pride and joy of the Council's army. They represent the ideal to which all other followers of the Council should aspire. Not only are they disciplined, well-trained soldiers, but their faith in the Council's supremacy is complete. Only those who have proven both their ability and loyalty are permitted to join the ranks of the Vortex."
// DisplayNames :
"P3128964316" "Vortex Assault"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2037326092" "The Vortex are the pride and joy of the Council's army. They represent the ideal to which all other followers of the Council should aspire. Not only are they disciplined, well-trained soldiers; but their faith in the Council's supremacy is complete. Only those who have proven both their ability and loyalty are permitted to join the ranks of the Vortex."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P196687688" "Vortex Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3267968330" "Vortex Marksman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P980783476" "Vortx Adjutants are zealots in every sense of the word. They believe in the Council's superiority so fiercely that they have become experts at recruiting new members from the disaffected elements of society. Vortex Adjutants are in equal parts soldier and proselytizer."
// DisplayNames :
"P423398111" "Vortex Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1687354221" "The Vortex Archons are the living essence of the Council's beliefs. While the Adjutants brim with enthusiasm, the Archons radiate a palpable aura of danger. The Vortex carefully foster this mystique in order to keep order within the ranks of the Council."
// DisplayNames :
"P1675851761" "Vortex Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3963454662" "Elite members of the Vortex have not only proven their loyalty to the cause, they've also shown themselves capable of bringing new members into the fold. Only those who have achieved Elite status are allowed to interact directly with potential recruits. Their fanatical devotion ensures that they'll either convert the potential member, or kill him. Either way, the secrets of the Council remain secure."
// DisplayNames :
"P3255382449" "Vortex Elite Assault"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P745484174" "Vortex Elite Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4055017898" "Vortex Elite Marksman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P197207903" "The Elite Vortex Adjutants are those destined for positions of authority in the Council hierarchy. Their authority supercedes nearly every other rank. These Adjutants reward the Council with the utmost devotion. By the time someone has reached this lofty level, he has given up any semblance of a normal life. He belongs to the Council, body and soul."
// DisplayNames :
"P709303871" "Vortex Elite Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3671742404" "The Vortex Elite Archons are among the few soldiers permitted to express their opinions to the Council's leaders, though most wisely avoid doing so. They control almost all the internal operations of the Council organization."
// DisplayNames :
"P3979327673" "Vortex Elite Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1390743772" "Every member of the Council aspires to become one of the Vortex Cor Leonis, but few of them achieve this lofty goal. They are the spiritual and philosophical leaders of the Council - totally devoted to its goal of world domination. Like any good soldier, they lead by example. Their intense training and physical enhancements make them perfect soldiers. In battle, they serve as an inspiration to all who fight at their side."
// DisplayNames :
"P717326850" "Vortex Cor Leonis Marksman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2901047846" "Vortex Cor Leonis Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Grenader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1910314778" "Vortex Cor Leonis Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1643685485" "Vortex Cor Leonis Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Sonic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3477645620" "Vortex Cor Leonis Sonic"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P764822004" "Vortex Cor Leonis Adjutants have the responsibility of leading large numbers of troops. They are concerned with training their men into peak fighting form - and recruiting new members to the Council. Until recently, none have ever been taken alive by the authorities."
// DisplayNames :
"P4046732695" "Vortex Cor Leonis Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2321436282" "The Vortex Cor Leonis Archons make up the inner circle that surrounds the Council leadership. They are charged with the grand stratagems that further the ultimate goal of the Council: the eventual domination of the world. The leaders of the Council foster a competitiveness between these high ranking officers in order to prevent any single one of them from acquiring too much power and becoming a threat."
// DisplayNames :
"P3489665675" "Vortex Cor Leonis Archon"

