// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Ascendant_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3269384736" "The personal guard of the Center, these crack soldiers are highly trained for protection and defense. Their equipment is geared toward healing and shielding their charge."
// DisplayNames :
"P2552079979" "Ascendant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Ascendant_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
