// DisplayDescription :
"P909311975" "The Tuatha De Danann and the Fir Bolg were tribes who fought for control of legendary Ireland, the Fir Bolg were the original inhabitants and refused to share the land with the Tuatha De Danann. Eochai was their king and Streng their Champion."
// GroupDescription :
"P2078102016" "Fir Bolg"
// DisplayNames :
"P3538590607" "Eochai"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Pumpkin_King_High 
