"P3948474232" "The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'Our basic model of chain-gun turret provides constant volumes of fire, capable of dissuading most intruders.'"
// GroupDescription :
"P2675884207" "Turrets"
// DisplayNames :
"P183747831" "Chain Gun Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GoodTurrets_PopUp_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
