// DisplayNames :
"P4042540563" "Pop Up Anti-Personnel Gun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GoodTurrets_PopUp_Turret_Base 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GoodTurrets_Dual_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P357543993" "The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'Our Dual Artillery Gun provides an excellent balance between the need for concentrated firepower and the desire to keep under budget. Ask about our options close-quarter flamethrower!'"
// DisplayNames :
"P2882659446" "Dual Artillery Gun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GoodTurrets_Quad_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3857933423" "The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'The Quad Howitzer Battery provides top-notch firepower for defending your installation with its four heavy cannons and optional flamethrower.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P535914398" "Quad Howitzer Battery"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GoodTurrets_Frag_Missile_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2757138302" "The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'When you need maximum defense and cost is no concern, the Hi-Explosive Missile Turret is the premier choice. It's high-powered explosive rockets can ruin the day for nearly any attacker.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P2288944920" "High-Explosive Missile Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GoodTurrets_Incindiary_Missile_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P222830068" "The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'When the Crey labs came up with a powerful new incendiary formula, it didn't take us a minute to think of modifying our already popular Missile Turrets to take advantage of it. We think you'll like the results.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P3144510668" "Incendiary Missile Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GoodTurrets_Gas_Missile_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2227746172" "The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'Sometimes even the strongest conventional defense isn't enough to dissuade some of the stranger threats your installation may face. Crey Industries is ready to provide you with the perfect solution when you need maximum levels of non-conventional force. Our Toxic Gas Missile Turrets can suppress even the most unconventional of foes with their deadly vapors.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P3929478591" "Toxic Gas Missile Turret"

